markdown_text = "# The End?
# It's Just The Beginning

## TERMNIUS ZERO


A game by [Hazoro](https://github.com/hazorox/) - [Vii](https://github.com/vii-abdullatif) - [AboEl5yr](https://github.com/adhammohamedkhairy)




Congrats!!
You fought, you travelled, you reached

To find nothing?

No, you found your origin, your spawn point

What was thought to be your end point, was your starting point, 

You find out to be an alien, that was originally a human

You are now SpX, your pronouns are spx/spax

Good luck with your life in space ^_^

THE BEGINNING

Check our github repo : [here](https://github.com/adhammohamedkhairy/terminus-zero)"
